      "text": "Cyclobenzaprine:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " usually 5 mg three times a day; by response, may increase to 10 mg three times a day. Use beyond 2 or 3 weeks is not recommended."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
