       }
      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " an MAOI now or within 14 days of stopping one (hyperpyretic crisis, seizures and deaths have occurred). CI: acute recovery phase of MI; arrhythmias, heart block or conduction disturbances, or HF. CI: hyperthyroidism."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
