    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Potentially life-threatening serotonin syndrome has been reported with SSRIs, SNRIs, TCAs, tramadol, bupropion, meperidine, verapamil or MAOIs. May enhance the effects of alcohol, barbiturates and other CNS depressants."
     }
